      "blocks": {
        "text_KmUR6b": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Shilajit: A Natural Supplement from the Himalayas</strong></span></p><p>Shilajit Resin is a unique and potent superfood from the high-altitude regions of the Himalayan Mountains. Our Shilajit is carefully collected from rocks located above 18,000 feet, ensuring its purity and quality.<br/><strong><br/>👨🏻‍⚕️ Ancient Wisdom Meets Modern Science</strong></p><p>By capitalizing on the raw strength of Mother Nature, our concoctions adhere to the most stringent of standards, each fortified by proven scientific studies.</p><p><strong>🔬 Modern Science</strong></p><p>We employ contemporary extraction methodologies, such as Supercritical CO2 extraction, to augment bioavailability and maximize concentration.</p><p><strong>💧 Pure & Potent</strong></p><p>Our commitment to purity is unwavering; our formulations exclusively feature natural extracts. Absolutely no additives or fillers are introduced.</p><p><strong>🛡️ Uncompromising Safety Standards</strong></p><p>Rigorous testing for purity and baseline levels ensures the safety of every batch. Our operations meet the strict quality controls of the FDA.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
