            "title_highlight_color": "#53af01",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_dQP6WY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our formula is backed by rigorous clinical research. In a controlled study, male participants between 45-55 years were divided into treatment and placebo groups. <strong>The treatment group received 250mg of purified Shilajit twice daily</strong>, while the control group received an identical-looking placebo.</p><p>After 90 days, comprehensive blood analysis revealed <strong>significant testosterone increases in the Shilajit group</strong> compared to no meaningful change in the placebo group. These hormonal improvements correlated directly with participants' reports of enhanced energy, libido, and overall wellbeing.</p><p><em><strong>Studies show that in just 8 weeks, Shilajit can help you:</strong></em></p><p><strong>💪🏻 Retain Muscle Strength by 80%</strong> – No more feeling wiped out after a workout. Shilajit can help you hold onto that hard-earned muscle, keeping you stronger for longer.</p><p><strong>😫 Reduce Fatigue by 50%</strong> – Imagine waking up feeling truly refreshed and ready to tackle the day. Shilajit can be your key to increased energy levels, both physically and mentally.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "button_wE4mTj": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "► TRY SHILAJIT",
